Z||000000||count_iblis||11-22-2000||04:04 PM||||I have a friend that just bought a 1984 fiero 2m4.  Well everyone in our group of friends rides on him for doing it.  To ease both of our pain from the riducule we recieve, I told the others that I would let them race my 1997 eclipse gs agaisnt the 2m4 fiero.  Now I would be drivng the fiero and anyone could drive the eclipse ( this is so it would be a fair race). So we all go to a parking lot last night at oh about 2:00 am and we start racing.  Each time I bet the person drivng my eclipse and each time each and everyone of them quits running there mouths.  So just to set some specs right, The 2m4 is a sohc 4 cylinder automatic with only 94 hp? While my eclipse is a DOHC 145 hp 5-speed. Only I wished I could raced the 86 fiero gt i have against the eclispe to even further impress the crowd of non believers.  But due to it having a operating on the 26th it wasnt possible.  <P>CHRIS  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/count-sig.gif"> ||||reg||11
Z||000001||Standard||11-22-2000||04:09 PM||||The 2m4 have overhead valves (OHV) not an overhead cam.  It only has 94 hp, but it has 130 ft/lbs of torque, so you should be able to take the eclipse off the line any day.  It also has a lot to do with driver skill for the eclipse, since it's a 5 speed.  Good showing, tho! <P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 153,000 miles and some busted up ground f/x  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/redface.gif"> <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000002||GT Bastard||11-22-2000||07:14 PM||||Off the line, I'd bet on the Fiero if it were a 4sp with the 4.10 tranny.  Since it's an auto, I think you're at a disadvantage. 5-sp Eclipses and Talons are pretty decent, even though the #'s might appear slightly in your favor.  ||||reg||1
Z||000003||count_iblis||11-22-2000||08:38 PM||||Well Im going back out there tonight and I will drive my Eclipse this time against  my friends Fiero. I will let you know how it goes.  Damn! I cant wait to get my Fiero back!<P>Chris<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/count-sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
